From 7a723d7c10f53ce0d6232ae17542784512b29ed7 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 22:50:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 3/7] feat(uc-compat): volumes with credential vending and
 OpenFGA authorization

Add uc_volume entity: Postgres schema with case-insensitive naming and
location-overlap checks spanning tabulars and volumes, CatalogVolumeOps
service layer, CatalogVolumeAction authorization with data-plane
exclusion from instance-admin bypass, UC-compatible /volumes CRUD and
/temporary-volume-credentials vending (aws/azure/gcp credential
mapping), and OpenFGA model v4.8 introducing lakekeeper_volume,
lakekeeper_function and lakekeeper_model types with assignments and
authorizer-actions permission endpoints for volumes.
